On Wed, Apr 22, 2026 at 08:17:11PM +0200, Mateusz Guzik wrote:
> It is being read surprisingly often (e.g., by mkdir, ls and even sed!).
> 
> This is lock-protected pointer chasing over a linked list to pay for
